      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "In a tough race without much recent form, BUSTER'S GIRL (4) was close up her last couple before a spell. In most of her starts she finds an on-pace position. The claim is a big help and she won't be doing much work to get forward. ZADOWS LANDING (1) comes over from some South Australian efforts. He runs all his best races here. Just has to carry the top weight. FAVAIOS (5) returns after a lot of similar runs last preparation. He too has his best form at this very course. Needs some luck early. CAPTAIN ROGERS (6) will get out of his ground but he is capable of finding the line. Has run in some decent form races. OREGON HIKER (2) should get a lovely run all the way. Just needs to improve at this track.",
